🧪 Tuning the Filters
You can adjust the constants at the top of the class if needed:

Parameter	Default	When to Change
MIN_AREA	200	Increase if too many small false positives.
MAX_AREA	15000	Decrease if large walls are mistakenly detected.
MIN_ASPECT	1.5	Pillars have aspect=2.0 – this range is safe.
MAX_ASPECT	4.0	
ROI_Y_MIN	30	Adjust if the camera is mounted higher/lower.
ROI_Y_MAX	210
also must make sure to fix sutter speed to the higest and the camer white colur balance
